msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

msgid "Using Orbit"
msgstr "使用 Orbit"

msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "实现原理"

msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "Orbit"

msgid "Orbit is a desktop genome browser for people who need to look at a locus *now*. It opens as a native window, needs no Java and no separately managed server. Annotations work offline; sequence requires a local source or access to the configured remote reference. In-memory remote caches are not a persistent offline genome download."
msgstr "Orbit 是一款桌面基因组浏览器，适合需要 *立即* 查看某个位点的用户。它以原生窗口打开，不需要 Java，也不需要单独管理的服务器。注释可离线使用；序列需要本地来源或访问已配置的远程参考。内存中的远程缓存不是持久化的离线基因组下载。"

msgid "RefSeq annotations are compiled into a binary index at build time, and sequence is read from UCSC 2bit files — from disk or over HTTP Range — so a whole chromosome of genes loads in milliseconds and the installer stays around 70 MB of annotation instead of carrying a 3 GB genome."
msgstr "RefSeq 注释在构建期就被编译成二进制索引，序列则直接从 UCSC 的 2bit 文件读取——本地磁盘或 HTTP Range 均可——所以一整条染色体的基因能在毫秒级加载，安装包只背约 70 MB 注释，而不是 3 GB 基因组。"

msgid "The Orbit window showing three loci side by side with signal tracks"
msgstr "Orbit 窗口：并排显示三个位点及信号轨道"

msgid "What you get"
msgstr "功能一览"

msgid "A native Qt window (no browser tab, no local server to babysit)"
msgstr "原生 Qt 窗口（不占浏览器标签页，无需照看本地服务）"

msgid "18 assemblies across 9 species, annotation bundled"
msgstr "9 个物种共 18 个装配，注释随包内置"

msgid "Gene models with transcript expansion, cytobands, GC and sequence tracks"
msgstr "基因模型可展开转录本，另有细胞遗传带、GC 与序列轨道"

msgid "Right-click a gene model for the transcript, exon/CDS/UTR fragment and every intron under the pointer, with coordinates and lengths"
msgstr "右键基因结构即可看到指针处的转录本、外显子 / CDS / UTR 片段以及全部内含子的区间与长度"

msgid "BAM and SAM as three labelled rows — coverage, splice junctions, alignments — with the four IGV display modes, wheel scrolling through every read, and a visibility window chosen from the experiment type"
msgstr "BAM 与 SAM 显示为三条带文件名的轨道——覆盖度、剪接位点、比对——支持 IGV 的四种显示方式、滚轮翻看全部 reads，并按实验类型决定可见窗口"

msgid "bigWig and bedGraph signal tracks, multi-sample overlays"
msgstr "bigWig / bedGraph 信号轨道，支持多样本叠加"

msgid "Copy-number SEG files: one track per sample, or a cohort heatmap"
msgstr "拷贝数 SEG 文件：单样本一条轨道，多样本一张热图"

msgid "Import your own bigWig, bedGraph, SEG, BAM, GTF or FASTA at runtime"
msgstr "运行时导入自己的 bigWig、bedGraph、SEG、BAM、GTF 或 FASTA"

msgid "A non-model organism works without a catalog entry: pick the empty **Custom** assembly and import your genome FASTA plus its GFF3"
msgstr "非模式物种不需要 catalog 条目：选空的 **自定义** 装配，导入自己的基因组 FASTA 和对应 GFF3 即可"

msgid "Split view, deep links, PNG / SVG / PDF export"
msgstr "分屏视图、深链接，导出 PNG / SVG / PDF"

msgid "This documentation is available in English and Chinese. Use the language selector at the top of the left sidebar to switch between ``English`` and ``简体中文``. The Chinese translation lives at ``/zh-cn/latest/`` on the same site."
msgstr "本文档提供英文和中文两个版本。用页面左侧栏顶部的语言选择器在 ``English`` 与 ``简体中文`` 之间切换，中文版位于同一站点的 ``/zh-cn/latest/`` 。"

